### Phase 17: Disputes and Admin Accountability
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@ownerToken = Bearer <owner_jwt>
@mentorToken = Bearer <mentor_jwt>
@adminAToken = Bearer <admin_a_jwt>
@adminBToken = Bearer <admin_b_jwt>
@superUserToken = Bearer <superuser_jwt>

### 1. Owner opens an escrow dispute on an active/accepted/payout_pending session
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-sessions/SESSION_ID/dispute
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The mentorship session ended early without covering the deliverables."
}

### 2. Attempting payout release while disputed -> 409 SESSION_DISPUTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentor-marketplace/sessions/SESSION_ID/complete
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

### 3. Admin lists open escrow disputes
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/disputes?status=open
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}

### 4. Admin decides dispute with 70/30 split (fee only on 70% mentor part)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/disputes/DISPUTE_ID/decide
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "split",
  "mentorPercent": 70,
  "reason": "Session delivered partial architecture guidance before ending early."
}

### 5. Admin inspects project escrow breakdown & reconciled totals
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/proj-1/escrow
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}

### 6. Admin exports audit log in CSV or JSON with filters (max 10,000 rows)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit/export?format=csv&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&actor=admin&action=escrow
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}

### 7. Admin checks 30-day owner rejection patterns & Review Pattern flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reports/owner-patterns
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}

### 8. Admin A attempts manual suspension of >90-day or >=150-rep user -> 202 pending_second_approval
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/2/suspend
Authorization: {{adminAToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Repeated harassment reported across multiple project workspaces."
}

### 9. List pending second-approval moderation actions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/moderation-actions?status=pending
Authorization: {{adminBToken}}

### 10. Different admin approves pending suspension -> 200 suspended
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/moderation-actions/ACTION_ID/approve
Authorization: {{adminBToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Verified chat evidence and duplicate complaint corroboration."
}

### 11. Different admin rejects pending suspension -> 200 rejected (user remains active)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/moderation-actions/ACTION_ID/reject
Authorization: {{adminBToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Insufficient corroborating evidence after reviewing project logs."
}

### 12. Super User triggers hourly tick (runs warningDecay, disputeSuperUserReminder, pendingModerationExpiry)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}
